  "result": "Perfect! All 396 tests pass. The bulk discount feature is now complete and working correctly. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Bulk Discount Implementation\n\n**Feature:**\n- Lines with 10 or more units automatically get an extra 2.5% discount\n- The bulk discount is applied *after* the line's own discount (or tier discount)\n- VAT is calculated on the amount after both discounts\n- The bulk discount is included in the total discount amount returned by `invoiceTotals`\n\n**Implementation in `src/totals.js`:**\n- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to check `line.qty >= 10`\n- If true, applies 2.5% bulk discount to the already-discounted amount\n- Includes bulk discount in the total discount calculation\n- VAT is calculated on the final discounted amount\n\n**Test Coverage Added to `test/totals.test.js`:**\n- Bulk discount for exactly 10 units and higher quantities\n- No bulk discount for 9 units or fewer\n- Bulk discount applied after line discount\n- Bulk discount with VAT calculations\n- Bulk discount combined with other features (multiple lines, vouchers)\n- Edge cases (100% line discount, large quantities)\n\n**Test Updates:**\n- Updated 5 existing tests in `test/invoices.test.js` that used qty >= 10 to account for the new bulk discount\n- Updated 1 test in `test/totals.test.js` to verify bulk discount math\n\nAll 396 tests pass, including 11 new bulk discount tests and updated existing tests.",
